{"id": "52eee019-bf80-48d3-b34b-4dc6176ed45d", "slug": "the-orbit-featured-studio", "title": "The Orbit — Featured Studio", "description": "Orbit Featured Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"The Orbit — Featured Studio\"\ndescription: \"Orbit Featured Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#C89A6B\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#B07C50\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#3C372D\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#3C372D\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Cormorant Garamond\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Jost\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# The Orbit — Featured Studio\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 260; favorites: 9; remixes: 1.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nOrbit Featured Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nCapacity 08 People Featured Studio The Orbit A focus driven space for bold ideas & AI creation Select Date Mon 19 Tue 20 Wed 21 May Thu 22 Fri 23 Select Time 8 AM 10 AM 12 PM 2 PM 4 PM 6 PM 8 PM Available Booked View St…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: The Orbit; Amenities.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #C89A6B, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #B07C50, background #FFFFFF, surface #3C372D, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Cormorant Garamond for display moments and Jost for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>The Orbit — Featured Studio</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&amp;family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen antialiased text-[#2a2722]\" style=\"background:#c9c2b6; font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;\">\n\n<main class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-10 lg:py-16\">\n\n  <!-- Gradient border wrapper -->\n  <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl rounded-[2.5rem] lg:rounded-[3.5rem] p-[1.5px]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.9), rgba(176,124,80,0.5) 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 70%, rgba(176,124,80,0.6)); box-shadow:0 50px 100px -30px rgba(60,50,40,0.45), 0 20px 40px -20px rgba(60,50,40,0.3);\">\n  <section aria-label=\"Featured studio booking card\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] lg:rounded-[3.5rem]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f5f1ea 0%, #efeae1 100%);\">\n\n    <!-- decorative orbit lines -->\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute top-16 left-1/2 -translate-x-8 hidden lg:block\" id=\"orbit-deco\">\n      <div class=\"w-72 h-44 rounded-[100%] border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(176,124,80,0.45); transform:rotate(-18deg);\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute top-2 right-8 w-2 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"background:#b07c50;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-10 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background:#b07c50;\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 relative\">\n\n      <!-- ===== LEFT : dark shape + circular image ===== -->\n      <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 relative\">\n        <div class=\"relative h-full min-h-[22rem] lg:min-h-[40rem] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[2.5rem] lg:rounded-none\" style=\"background:#23241f; border-radius:2.5rem 2.5rem 0 0;\">\n          <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute inset-0\" style=\"background:#23241f; border-radius:3.5rem 0 14rem 3.5rem;\"></div>\n          <div class=\"lg:hidden absolute inset-0\" style=\"background:#23241f;\"></div>\n\n          <!-- sparkle ornament -->\n          <div class=\"absolute top-7 left-7 lg:top-10 lg:left-10 w-14 h-14 rounded-full border flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"border-color:rgba(186,142,98,0.6);\" id=\"spark-badge\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"color:#c89a6b;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iconify-icon>\n          </div>\n          <!-- dotted track -->\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-24 left-4 h-72 border-l border-dashed\" style=\"border-color:rgba(186,142,98,0.35);\"></div>\n\n          <!-- circular image with gradient ring -->\n          <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 lg:left-auto lg:-right-20 lg:translate-x-0 w-[19rem] h-[19rem] sm:w-[23rem] sm:h-[23rem] lg:w-[26rem] lg:h-[26rem] rounded-full p-[2px]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(200,154,107,0.9), rgba(255,255,255,0.35), rgba(200,154,107,0.5)); box-shadow:0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);\" id=\"studio-photo\">\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n              <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/e445a53d-a3a2-4c40-a9b2-f2381ba9a517_3840w.webp\" alt=\"Warm minimalist studio meeting room with round table and soft circular ceiling light\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[2000ms] hover:scale-105\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- capacity card -->\n          <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-6 lg:bottom-12 lg:left-8 rounded-3xl p-[1.5px] z-10\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(200,154,107,0.7), rgba(255,255,255,0.15), rgba(200,154,107,0.35));\" id=\"capacity-card\">\n            <div class=\"rounded-3xl px-6 py-5 backdrop-blur\" style=\"background:rgba(28,29,24,0.92);\">\n              <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#9b948a;\">Capacity</p>\n              <p class=\"text-4xl font-light mt-1\" style=\"color:#efe9df; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;\"><span id=\"cap-count\">08</span></p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mt-1\" style=\"color:#9b948a;\">People</p>\n              <div class=\"flex gap-1.5 mt-3\" style=\"color:#c89a6b;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\"></iconify-icon><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\"></iconify-icon><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\"></iconify-icon><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\"></iconify-icon><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ===== CENTER : booking content ===== -->\n      <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 px-7 sm:px-10 lg:pl-28 lg:pr-6 pt-10 lg:pt-16 pb-8 relative\">\n        <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-medium\" style=\"color:#b07c50;\" data-reveal=\"\">Featured Studio</p>\n\n        <h1 class=\"mt-3 text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl tracking-tight font-medium\" style=\"font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; color:#22211d;\" data-reveal=\"\">The Orbit</h1>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-light max-w-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5b564d;\" data-reveal=\"\">A focus driven space for bold ideas &amp; AI creation</p>\n\n        <!-- Date selector -->\n        <div class=\"mt-10\">\n          <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#86806f;\" data-reveal=\"\">Select Date</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Select a date\">\n            <button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"date-pill flex-1 rounded-2xl py-4 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(60,55,45,0.12); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">\n              <span class=\"block text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#86806f;\">Mon</span>\n              <span class=\"block text-2xl mt-1 font-light\" style=\"font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;\">19</span>\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"date-pill flex-1 rounded-2xl py-4 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(60,55,45,0.12); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">\n              <span class=\"block text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#86806f;\">Tue</span>\n              <span class=\"block text-2xl mt-1 font-light\" style=\"font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;\">20</span>\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\" class=\"date-pill flex-1 rounded-2xl py-5 text-center -translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#23241f; box-shadow:0 18px 30px -12px rgba(35,36,31,0.6);\">\n              <span class=\"block text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#9b948a;\">Wed</span>\n              <span class=\"block text-3xl mt-1 font-light\" style=\"color:#c89a6b; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;\">21</span>\n              <span class=\"block text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mt-1\" style=\"color:#9b948a;\">May</span>\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"date-pill flex-1 rounded-2xl py-4 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(60,55,45,0.12); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">\n              <span class=\"block text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#86806f;\">Thu</span>\n              <span class=\"block text-2xl mt-1 font-light\" style=\"font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;\">22</span>\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"date-pill flex-1 rounded-2xl py-4 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(60,55,45,0.12); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">\n              <span class=\"block text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#86806f;\">Fri</span>\n              <span class=\"block text-2xl mt-1 font-light\" style=\"font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;\">23</span>\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next week\" class=\"shrink-0 w-9 h-9 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-colors hover:bg-white\" style=\"color:#5b564d;\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background:#b07c50;\"></span>\n            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background:rgba(60,55,45,0.2);\"></span>\n            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background:rgba(60,55,45,0.2);\"></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Time selector -->\n        <div class=\"mt-8\">\n          <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#86806f;\" data-reveal=\"\">Select Time</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-between text-xs tracking-[0.15em]\" style=\"color:#86806f;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span>8 AM</span><span>10 AM</span><span>12 PM</span><span>2 PM</span><span>4 PM</span><span>6 PM</span><span>8 PM</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"relative mt-3 h-9\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Time availability bar, 2 PM to 4 PM selected\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex\" id=\"timebar\">\n              <div class=\"h-full\" style=\"width:18%; background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(60,55,45,0.12) 0 4px, transparent 4px 8px);\"></div>\n              <div class=\"h-full\" style=\"width:24%; background:#23241f;\"></div>\n              <div class=\"h-full\" style=\"width:14%; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);\"></div>\n              <div class=\"h-full\" style=\"width:16%; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);\"></div>\n              <div class=\"h-full\" style=\"width:16%; background:#23241f;\"></div>\n              <div class=\"h-full\" style=\"width:12%; background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(60,55,45,0.12) 0 4px, transparent 4px 8px);\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- selected window with gradient border -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-1.5 -bottom-1.5 rounded-xl p-[1.5px]\" style=\"left:42%; width:14%; background:linear-gradient(135deg, #c89a6b, rgba(255,255,255,0.8), #b07c50);\" id=\"time-window\">\n              <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-xl\" style=\"background:rgba(245,241,234,0.85);\"></div>\n              <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -bottom-7 flex flex-col items-center\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <span class=\"w-px h-4\" style=\"background:#b07c50;\"></span>\n                <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border-2\" style=\"border-color:#b07c50; background:#f5f1ea;\"></span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-6 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#5b564d;\" data-reveal=\"\">\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"background:#2fae6c;\"></span>Available</span>\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"background:#23241f;\"></span>Booked</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- CTA row -->\n        <div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\">\n          <a href=\"#tour\" class=\"group flex-1 rounded-2xl p-[1.5px] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(176,124,80,0.5), rgba(255,255,255,0.9), rgba(176,124,80,0.4));\">\n            <span class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-2xl px-8 py-4 text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-medium\" style=\"background:#f5f1ea; color:#2a2722;\">\n              View Studio\n              <span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-45\" style=\"border-color:rgba(60,55,45,0.25);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n              </span>\n            </span>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#reserve\" class=\"group flex-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-2xl px-8 py-4 text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-medium transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a8744a,#c1905f); color:#fdf8f1; box-shadow:0 18px 35px -14px rgba(168,116,74,0.7);\">\n            Reserve Studio\n            <span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\" style=\"border-color:rgba(253,248,241,0.4);\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n            </span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- collection footer -->\n        <div class=\"mt-10 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#5b564d;\" data-reveal=\"\">\n          <span>AI Studio<br class=\"hidden sm:block\"> Collection</span>\n          <span class=\"flex-1 max-w-[7rem] h-px\" style=\"background:rgba(176,124,80,0.6);\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <span style=\"color:#86806f;\">/ 07</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ===== RIGHT : availability + amenities ===== -->\n      <div class=\"lg:col-span-3 px-7 sm:px-10 lg:px-8 pb-10 lg:pb-0 lg:pt-10 flex flex-col\">\n        <!-- live availability pill -->\n        <div class=\"flex lg:justify-end\">\n          <div class=\"rounded-full p-[1.5px]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(176,124,80,0.4), rgba(255,255,255,0.9));\" id=\"live-pill\">\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase\" style=\"background:#f5f1ea; color:#5b564d;\">\n              Live Availability\n              <span class=\"relative flex w-2 h-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <span class=\"absolute inline-flex w-full h-full rounded-full animate-ping\" style=\"background:#2fae6c; opacity:0.6;\"></span>\n                <span class=\"relative inline-flex w-2 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"background:#2fae6c;\"></span>\n              </span>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- bronze medallion -->\n        <div class=\"relative mt-8 lg:mt-10 self-center lg:self-start lg:-ml-6\" id=\"medallion\">\n          <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -inset-6 rounded-full border border-dashed\" style=\"border-color:rgba(176,124,80,0.45);\" id=\"medallion-ring\"></div>\n          <div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #d9a878, #9a6a40 70%); box-shadow:0 20px 35px -12px rgba(120,80,45,0.7), inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:sun-linear\" class=\"text-3xl\" style=\"color:#f7ecdd;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iconify-icon>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- amenities panel -->\n        <div class=\"mt-8 lg:mt-10 rounded-3xl lg:rounded-none p-[1.5px] lg:flex-1\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(200,154,107,0.55), rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 50%, rgba(200,154,107,0.3)); border-radius:1.75rem 1.75rem 1.75rem 1.75rem;\">\n          <div class=\"h-full px-7 py-8\" style=\"background:#23241f; border-radius:1.7rem; clip-path:polygon(0 6%, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%);\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-medium mt-2\" style=\"color:#c89a6b;\" data-reveal=\"\">Amenities</h2>\n            <ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-4\" id=\"amenities-list\">\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                <span class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" style=\"border-color:rgba(200,154,107,0.4); color:#c89a6b;\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:monitor-linear\"></iconify-icon></span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#d8d2c7;\">8K Presentation</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                <span class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" style=\"border-color:rgba(200,154,107,0.4); color:#c89a6b;\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pen-new-square-linear\"></iconify-icon></span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#d8d2c7;\">AI Collab Board</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                <span class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" style=\"border-color:rgba(200,154,107,0.4); color:#c89a6b;\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:videocamera-record-linear\"></iconify-icon></span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#d8d2c7;\">Holo Conference</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                <span class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" style=\"border-color:rgba(200,154,107,0.4); color:#c89a6b;\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:volume-loud-linear\"></iconify-icon></span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#d8d2c7;\">Sound Immersion</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                <span class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" style=\"border-color:rgba(200,154,107,0.4); color:#c89a6b;\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cup-hot-linear\"></iconify-icon></span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#d8d2c7;\">Espresso Bar</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                <span class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" style=\"border-color:rgba(200,154,107,0.4); color:#c89a6b;\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:armchair-linear\"></iconify-icon></span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#d8d2c7;\">Private Lounge</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6 border-t\" style=\"border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n              <a href=\"#details\" class=\"group flex items-center justify-between text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#efe9df;\">\n                View Details\n                <span class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full border flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-45\" style=\"border-color:rgba(200,154,107,0.5); color:#c89a6b;\">\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                </span>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n  // ---- Masked staggered word reveal ----\n  document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-reveal]\").forEach(function (el) {\n    var words = el.innerHTML.split(/(<br[^>]*>)/g).map(function (chunk) {\n      if (/^<br/.test(chunk)) return chunk;\n      return chunk.split(\" \").filter(Boolean).map(function (w) {\n        return '<span style=\"display:inline-block; overflow:hidden; vertical-align:top;\"><span class=\"reveal-word\" style=\"display:inline-block; transform:translateY(110%);\">' + w + \"&nbsp;</span></span>\";\n      }).join(\"\");\n    }).join(\"\");\n    el.innerHTML = words;\n    gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll(\".reveal-word\"), {\n      y: 0,\n      duration: 0.9,\n      ease: \"power4.out\",\n      stagger: 0.06,\n      scrollTrigger: { trigger: el, start: \"top 90%\" }\n    });\n  });\n\n  // ---- Detail element animations ----\n  gsap.from(\"#studio-photo\", { scale: 0.85, opacity: 0, duration: 1.4, ease: \"power3.out\",\n    scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#studio-photo\", start: \"top 90%\" } });\n\n  gsap.from(\"#capacity-card\", { y: 40, opacity: 0, duration: 1, ease: \"power3.out\", delay: 0.3,\n    scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#capacity-card\", start: \"top 95%\" } });\n\n  gsap.from(\".date-pill\", { y: 24, opacity: 0, duration: 0.7, ease: \"power3.out\", stagger: 0.08, clearProps: \"opacity\",\n    scrollTrigger: { trigger: \".date-pill\", start: \"top 92%\" } });\n\n  gsap.from(\"#timebar > div\", { scaleX: 0, transformOrigin: \"left center\", duration: 0.8, ease: \"power2.out\", stagger: 0.1,\n    scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#timebar\", start: \"top 92%\" } });\n\n  gsap.from(\"#time-window\", { opacity: 0, scale: 0.7, duration: 0.8, ease: \"back.out(2)\", delay: 0.6,\n    scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#timebar\", start: \"top 92%\" } });\n\n  gsap.from(\"#amenities-list li\", { x: 30, opacity: 0, duration: 0.7, ease: \"power3.out\", stagger: 0.1,\n    scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#amenities-list\", start: \"top 88%\" } });\n\n  gsap.from([\"#live-pill\", \"#medallion\"], { y: -20, opacity: 0, duration: 0.9, ease: \"power3.out\", stagger: 0.15,\n    scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#live-pill\", start: \"top 95%\" } });\n\n  // continuous ambient motion\n  gsap.to(\"#medallion-ring\", { rotate: 360, duration: 30, repeat: -1, ease: \"none\", transformOrigin: \"center\" });\n  gsap.to(\"#spark-badge\", { rotate: 360, duration: 24, repeat: -1, ease: \"none\" });\n  gsap.to(\"#orbit-deco\", { y: 10, duration: 4, yoyo: true, repeat: -1, ease: \"sine.inOut\" });\n\n  // capacity count-up\n  var capObj = { v: 0 }, capEl = document.getElementById(\"cap-count\");\n  gsap.to(capObj, { v: 8, duration: 1.4, ease: \"power2.out\",\n    scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#capacity-card\", start: \"top 95%\" },\n    onUpdate: function () { capEl.textContent = String(Math.round(capObj.v)).padStart(2, \"0\"); } });\n\n  // date pill selection\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".date-pill\").forEach(function (pill) {\n    pill.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      document.querySelectorAll(\".date-pill\").forEach(function (p) { p.setAttribute(\"aria-checked\", \"false\"); });\n      pill.setAttribute(\"aria-checked\", \"true\");\n      gsap.fromTo(pill, { scale: 0.95 }, { scale: 1, duration: 0.4, ease: \"back.out(3)\" });\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "the-orbit-featured-studio.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/the-orbit-featured-studio.jpg", "source_name": "the-orbit-featured-studio-DESIGN.md", "views": 284, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T14:50:42.59903+00:00"}